00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:45,000
An epic quest. A magical guitar pick. A chance to put the D in Destiny.

2
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:24,000
Tenacious D in The Pick of Destiny is a comedy, music,
fantasy film directed by Liam Lynch.

3
00:13:57,000 --> 00:14:03,000
In Venice Beach, naive Midwesterner JB bonds with local
slacker KG and they form the rock band Tenacious D.

4
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:42,000
Setting out to become the world's greatest band is no easy feat, so they set
out to steal what could be the answer to their prayers...

5
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:21,000
a magical guitar pick housed in a rock-and-roll museum some 300 miles away.

6
00:27:54,000 --> 00:28:00,000
JB, played by Jack Black.

7
00:32:33,000 --> 00:32:39,000
KG, played by Kyle Gass.

8
00:37:12,000 --> 00:37:18,000
Lee, played by JR Reed.

9
00:41:51,000 --> 00:41:57,000
